# Two Emrakul, the Exigent Doom grants are separate effects, each ending with its own card (CR 611.2a, 400.7). Bot1 exiles
# the first Emrakul on turn 1 to give its Island "{T}: Add {C}{C}", and the second on turn 3 to give its Swamp the same.
# The grants outlast the turns they were made on. On turn 5 Bot1 casts the first Emrakul from exile, the Swamp's {C}{C}
# paying for part of it: once it is cast the Island has lost its ability and the Swamp keeps its own, which the other
# Emrakul, still in exile, gave it. The cast trigger untaps both lands to show it, and only Bot1's lands: the Mana Crypt
# and the Plains Bot2 tapped in response stay tapped.

